[{"client_msg_id":"e3a7cb0e-2a49-4a29-9692-f1fbeb74ec0d","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"lua の module として plugin の設定ファイルを切り分け、`require` しています。 (変数 `M` の名前は別に何でもいいです)。上記の書き方は、module に定義されている関数(オブジェクト)を `config` に渡しています。こうすると `packer_compiled.lua`  に直接関数が埋め込まれるので速度的に有利かなーと思ってこう書いてました(あんま効果なさそう)。\n\npacker  の config, setup には文字列を渡せば lua の設定として認識するので、\n```use {\"hoge/hage.vim\",config = [[require(\"plugins.config.hage\").config()]]}```\nとかでもOKです。こっちの方が読み易いかも。","ts":"1630418616.054900","edited":{"user":"UGN0T63GC","ts":"1630419124.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OjnE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d54bda83-a56c-410d-a597-6e5abbfd2ca4","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"プラグイン個別の設定で\n`local M = {}`\n`function M.config()`\n`-- 色々設定する`\n`end`\n`return M`\nとして\nPacker側で\n`use {\"hoge/hage.vim\",config = require(\"plugins.config.hage\").config}`\nで読み込んでるのはluaの記法なのですか？","ts":"1630415244.049700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mgKW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35e613be-b38b-4870-8856-c0201aeed0a6","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"tj とか packer.nvim の作者とか glepnir さん(元かぐや様)とかの設定参考にしてます。","ts":"1630411742.046500","edited":{"user":"UGN0T63GC","ts":"1630411759.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=h/tm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2aa35318-5118-4753-9599-a7ba78971313","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"参考になるかは分かりませんが、自分の設定はこんな感じです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/hydeik/dotfiles/tree/master/editors/nvim\u003e","ts":"1630411551.045500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hk72"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CACBE16D-4485-4543-9691-E8FDD19BC9B2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"luaにしてないけど参考になるやつ読みたい","ts":"1630411223.044900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MmaQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05CD86BB-CA8A-4AC7-BD53-0A49BE563C6F","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"Ikenoさんのdotfilesめっちゃ参考にさせて頂いてます:pray: ","ts":"1630410209.043600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"raised_hands","count":1,"users":["UGN0T63GC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ex3u6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b915b50f-1cb2-4741-b1a5-d0ff7c8d3ac4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"わかる。あと、既存のマッピングを踏み潰したケースの場合は fallback 関数が与えられるとなおよい。","ts":"1630408843.042700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UGN0T63GC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xCXY2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"685DE9AC-C68B-44FC-99B1-4E4DBB36B5F2","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"今のデフォAPIだとrhsにfunction渡せないのが不便なんですよね。自分も似たようなことしてます","ts":"1630407376.042000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UGN0T63GC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"imz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a84e4dbe-d063-40eb-8be1-73909c444537","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"vim.keymap のインターフェイスは \u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/13823\u003e\n で提案されているものです (現在は API をどうするかで議論になっているようですが)。\n\nTJ がそれを実験的に実装した plugin があるので、それをインストールすれば使えます。\n\u003chttps://github.com/tjdevries/astronauta.nvim\u003e","ts":"1630404340.038700","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/13823|#13823 WIP: lua keymaps and docs\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/13823|#13823 WIP: lua keymaps and docs\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim|neovim/neovim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1611533088},{"color":"24292f","fallback":"tjdevries/astronauta.nvim","id":2,"title":"tjdevries/astronauta.nvim","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"101","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Lua","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UJ70JTGR3","U011FTGJ3SN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FcFW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"229ad3ef-7b85-4a60-ae03-eaf59c470a7b","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1630398062.036100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M2TI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"949785f1-bcc7-4b02-a415-48f35e0e60d8","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"なるほど\n自前で定義してやる訳ですね","ts":"1630398054.035700","edited":{"user":"U011FTGJ3SN","ts":"1630398076.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yly9d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4430f8fd-e5cc-4286-818e-eb97d555e3b0","type":"message","user":"UJ70JTGR3","text":"`vim.keymap` は定義されていない気がしますね\n似たようなことをやるなら\n```local nnoremap = function(l, r)\n  vim.api.nvim_set_keymap(\"n\", l, r, { noremap = true, silent = true })\nend\n\nnnoremap(\"Q\", \"q\")```\nこんな感じですかね","ts":"1630397949.035200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yPl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0500b0a-8b2e-4195-a17e-f26acf182edd","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"luaの設定で質問なんですが、keymapの設定で例えば\n`api.nvim_set_keymap(\"n\", \"Q\", \"q\", { noremap = true, silent = true })`\nとは書かずに\n`local nnoremap = vim.keymap.nnoremap`\n `nnoremap { \"Q\", \"q\" }`\nこう書く記法をみかけたのですが、手元で真似してみたところ`attempt to index field 'keymap' (a nil value)` が出てうごかず、これはどんなテクニックなのか分かる方いませんか","ts":"1630397668.034200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W8cs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"283ac94e-b7ad-4275-826e-e83f014c1feb","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"ですね。私の場合は、設定ファイルが lua、かつ使っているプラグインの大半が  lua 製なので効果があったのかと。\n(nvim と vim の設定を分けることを決意した時に、nvim の設定は lua で書くことにした人)","ts":"1630396525.028600","edited":{"user":"UGN0T63GC","ts":"1630396546.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nd5u5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32ae7d5d-c253-4ae4-925b-be4e64085fac","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私の環境では（すべて遅延起動させており）Luaのロードをしてないので起動が逆に遅くなってしまった","ts":"1630396307.025100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cj1m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a98c2bc0-24fa-4e17-b937-fca030698bc9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"起動時にLuaのロードがある場合にはこうかがあると思われますね","ts":"1630396272.024000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"azo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9fe6f4d-80cd-4251-8919-196926c5b1f3","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/lewis6991/impatient.nvim\u003e  を試してみました。\n起動時間 80 ms → 67 ms に短縮。私の場合、遅延ロードの設定頑張ってやってたので大幅削減とはいきませんが、有意に効果はありそうです。","ts":"1630395922.023100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"lewis6991/impatient.nvim","id":1,"title":"lewis6991/impatient.nvim","text":"Improve startup time for Neovim","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"114","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Lua","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2qvb0"}]}]
